# Basic Master Jr. tape list
#
# This file lives at /media/fat/games/BasicMasterJr/boot1.rom. MiSTer loads it
# when the core starts, so reload the core after editing it. It is plain text,
# despite the name.
#
# The tape doesn't record where a program starts. The core assumes it starts
# where its first block loads. This list corrects that and adds a note to the
# start hint ("TYPE G 2500 <space>" plus a second line).
#
# One program per line, fields separated by spaces:
#
#   NAME  LOAD  START  [END]  [| NOTE]
#
#   NAME   the 6-character name in the tape header, as L or LOAD prints it
#   LOAD   the address the first block loads at (hex), or - for any
#   START  the address to start it with G (hex), or - to keep LOAD
#   END    optional: the last address the file loads (hex), to match
#          only one version of a program
#   NOTE   after a |, up to 22 characters, shown under the start command;
#          upper case and ASCII only (the machine has no lower case)
#
# For a tape with machine code then a BASIC program, the line is for the
# BASIC one (its LOAD is 0600). Lines starting with # or ; are comments.
# The first matching line wins.

# Machine code that doesn't start at its load address
CAR     2000  2500  | S GO NM STEER CTRL GAS
CF      0C00  0F00  | S START ,. MOVE Z FIRE
ALS     2500  34BC  | S START JK MOVE Z FIRE

# zu2
GALAXY  -     -     | V N MOVE CTRL FAST
DENDAI  1000  -     | OK PROMPT: TRY PR.6*7
LIFE2   3000  -     | @*# PLACE  RETURN RUNS

# Magazine type-ins (BASIC)
HELMET  -     -     | S START ,. MOVE
GORILA  -     -     | S START
WINE    -     -     | Y TO PLAY
DRINKC  -     -     | S START
KUROKA  -     -     | ALT UP  CAPS DOWN
OPA     -     -     | S START IJKM SPC CAST
WILWSP  -     -     | ,. MOVE
MISSIL  -     -     | SPACE START ,. MOVE
KONG    -     -     | IJKM MOVE A S JUMP
URU     -     -     | S START IJKM MOVE
GU      -     -     | S START ,. SPACE FIRE
TOBI    -     -     | Y PLAY SPACE JUMP
JUMPS   -     -     | RETURN START Z JUMP
SH      -     -     | A Z UP DOWN
TR      -     -     | SEXD MOVE M FIRE
DW      -     -     | IJKM MOVE
SMO     -     -     | O K M THROWS
BF      -     -     | S START ,. SPACE FIRE
PAL     -     -     | S START ,. MOVE Z FIRE
FC      -     -     | WZ MOVE SPACE TONGUE
MT      -     -     | SPACE START Z FIRE
UB      -     -     | ,. MOVE Z MISSILE
